<title>CHAD: SOCCER-ASCOT OF CHAD BEAT AFRICA SPORTS 2-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ASCOT OF CHAD BEAT AFRICA SPORTS 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>N'DJAMENA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ascot of Chad beat Africa</p>
<p>Sports of Ivory Coast 2-1 on Friday in their second leg match in</p>
<p>the African Champions Cup.</p>
<p>Africa win 4-2 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
